323:| D-4B.2-lessons | (1) An A/B probe must not let either side under test generate the stimulus. (2) Stimulus scripts get a validity control before their verdicts count. (3) PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 REQUIRED for mutation-lock drivers; M8 drivers diagnose EVERY precondition loudly incl. their own scratch parent, and their certification runs in the fresh-checkout environment. (4) A test-local tag string can trip a static ratchet that cannot tell it from the real thing: rename, never allowlist, state the constraint in-file. (5) The search path is a request; the resolved `__file__` is the fact — every A/B probe resolves and asserts the module it measures (F-4: cwd outranks PYTHONPATH under `python -m`). (6) Any hash/count/SHA in a handoff or certification is GENERATED BY THE COMMAND that records it, and the receiver recomputes on receipt (F-5). (7) Reconcile every sourced number against every figure it bears on (DEV-3, jointly earned). (8) A LEDGER carry sweep for the slot's own name is a standing dispatch-checklist item (the untranscluded-carries erratum). (9) The brief's timing-hygiene floor applies to MEASURED deadlines; setup timeouts are exempt only when determinism is BY CONSTRUCTION and stated | banked, binding forward |
